8","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun-ws2087998","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun:p018","mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun:p018:m0118","quote":"伯父"},{"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-058","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun-ws2087998","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun:p034","mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun:p034:m0004","quote":"楊播"}],"identity_note":"本傳明楊播字延慶本元休；父懿、子侃、華陰子進伯；北史同事鏈首選，外參不合字異人。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-058","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-ws2087998","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p001","quote":"楊播，字延慶，自云恒農華陰人也。高祖結，仕慕容氏，卒於中山相。曾祖珍，太祖時歸國，卒於上谷太守。祖真，河內、清河二郡太守。父懿，延興末為廣平太守，有稱績。高祖南巡，吏人頌之，加寧遠將軍，賜帛三百匹。徵為選部給事中，有公平之譽。除安南將軍、洛州刺史，未之任而卒。贈以本官，加弘農公，諡曰簡。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p001:m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p001:m0062","source_term":"父懿"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-weishu058-yang-001","interpretation_note":"僅明近系直接父親，ID後綴非排行；未知婚配不補。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）"}},{"id":"r47_vug_gx5","label":"王氏〔楊播母〕","status":"ai_provisional","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"王氏","mention_ids":["c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p002:m0017"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-058","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-ws2087998","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p002","mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p002:m0017","quote":"王氏"}],"identity_note":"母王氏明示，文明太后之外姑原詞保留；不造王氏父名或外姑中介。"}],"source_mention_summary":[{"sour